        "slug": "global-surf-adventures"
      },
      "businessName": "Global Surf Lodge Kabalana",
      "businessType": "surf_camp",
      "tagline": "Surf weeks for all levels on Sri Lanka's south coast, a few steps from the ocean.",
      "closing": "Book the week for your level. Not sure which one fits? Ask us on WhatsApp first.",
      "featureLine": "Footwear is discouraged. Chilling out is inescapable.",
      "languages": [
        "en"
      ],
      "languagesSpoken": [],
      "copyBlocks": [
        {
          "id": "seed-block-1",
          "slot": "intro",
          "heading": "Next set is yours",
          "body": "We are surfing obsessed, and we invite you to join us.\n\nThe lodge sits in the green of the jungle. We run surf weeks for three levels, from your first wave to carving, and a Freestylers package for independent travellers."
        },
        {
          "id": "seed-block-2",
          "slot": "about",
          "heading": "Surf, breakfast, surf again",
          "body": "Head out with your group for a morning surf. Back at the lodge, a big, healthy breakfast is waiting.\n\nAfter that the day is yours: relax at the lodge, or go out and explore before the afternoon surf. The evening ends with dinner, together with the other guests."
        },
        {
          "id": "seed-block-3",
          "slot": "offer",
          "heading": "Pick your level",
          "body": "Level 1 – Fomies is for your first time on a board, no surfing experience needed. You learn on soft boards, on easy reef breaks and the sandy beaches around the lodge.\n\nLevel 2 – Rollers is for when you can stand up, but paddling out to the line-up and catching green waves is still a struggle. You surf easy reefs and beach breaks with deep-water channels, on soft boards.\n\nLevel 3 – Riders: you're already carving, and you want to sharpen your skills. From Galle to Matara, you surf the best spot of the day for the conditions, the wind and the tide.\n\nFreestylers is the package for independent travellers who want to soak up the lodge's vibe."
        },
        {
          "id": "seed-block-4",
          "slot": "offer",
          "heading": "One price, three levels",
          "body": "The three surf weeks cost the same, per person for seven nights. That is the base price the booking engine showed on 28 September 2026. The room you choose can add to it; the engine shows any supplement once you pick your dates.\n\nPackages start on a Saturday and run for 7, 14, 21 or 28 nights, for up to six guests per booking. Drinking water and local coffee and tea are unlimited."
        },
        {
          "id": "seed-block-5",
          "slot": "about",
          "heading": "Twelve rooms, one big family",
          "body": "There are just twelve rooms. That keeps a stay here personal, part of one big happy family. Every room has air conditioning, a ceiling fan, a safe box, a private toilet and shower, a socket next to each bed and, of course, a board rack.\n\nWhen you're not on the water, lie out on a sunbed by the pool under the palms, hang out in the common area, take an ice-cold drink from the bar, or eat Sri Lankan produce from the lodge kitchen."
        },
        {
          "id": "seed-block-6",
          "slot": "about",
          "heading": "What guests say",
          "body": "Booking.com guests score the staff 9.5 out of 10, and the facilities and the cleanliness 9.2 each.\n\nIn their reviews they write about the pool area, the open-air bathroom and the breakfast bowls."
        },
        {
          "id": "seed-block-7",
          "slot": "info",
          "heading": "Getting here",
          "body": "Booking.com puts Kathaluwa West Beach 40 m from the lodge and Kabalana Beach 350 m. Kathaluwa station is 400 m away, Ahangama Beach 4 km and Koggala Airport 3.9 km."
        }
      ],
